---
kind: lore
id: east.portvolt
title: Portvolt, the harbor town
---

// Portvolt: the Meridian's home port, Lt. Volta's Spark Gym (behind the
// portvoltTree gate), the lighthouse, and the Wednesday market
// (scenes/east/portvolt-market.lute). The first visit is east.portvoltArrival.

// ── services ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat id="center" on="heal" target="town.portvolt" title="Monster Center" once="false">
  ::use{component="nurse" town="portvolt" instance="use-001"}
</beat>

<beat id="mart" on="shop" target="town.portvolt" title="Mart" once="false">
  ::use{component="shop" stock="portvoltStock" instance="use-001"}
</beat>

// ── walking in, after the first visit (once a day per slot) ────────────────

<entry id="eastPortvoltMorning" on="enterTown" target="town.portvolt" category="ambient" priority="5" once="day" when="@isMorning">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Gulls over the harbor, and the smell of the fish auction. The Meridian's horn sounds twice across the water.
</entry>

<entry id="eastPortvoltDay" on="enterTown" target="town.portvolt" category="ambient" priority="5" once="day" when="run.slot == 'day'">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The docks are loud with cranes and crates. Somewhere a sailor is losing an argument with a pelipper.
</entry>

<entry id="eastPortvoltNight" on="enterTown" target="town.portvolt" category="ambient" priority="5" once="day" when="@isNight">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The lighthouse sweeps the harbor. Every few sweeps the streetlamps flicker, all together, as if something far away had blinked.
</entry>

// ── Harbormaster Quill ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="eastQuillBark" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltHarbormaster" category="bark">
  @portvoltHarbormaster{code="0010"}: Ships in, ships out. The Meridian sails for Tidewell on Mondays and back on Thursdays. Don't miss it; the captain won't wait.
</entry>

<entry id="eastQuillMorning" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltHarbormaster" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isMorning">
  @portvoltHarbormaster{code="0010"}: Early! Good. The fog burns off by nine. Until then, watch your step on the pier: the tentacool don't.
</entry>

<entry id="eastQuillNight" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltHarbormaster" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isNight">
  @portvoltHarbormaster{code="0010"}: Harbor's closed. If you're looking for trouble, the bikers are up on Route 7. If you're looking for sleep, the Center has beds.
</entry>

<entry id="eastQuillSpark" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltHarbormaster" category="bark" priority="20" once="run" when="holds('hasBadge', ['spark'])">
  @portvoltHarbormaster{code="0010"}: You beat the Lieutenant? He'll be insufferable for a week. He's insufferable when he wins, too, mind.
</entry>

// ── Old Ned, the fisherman: the Good Rod ─────────────────────────────────

<beat id="nedRod" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltFisher" title="The Good Rod" priority="10">
  @portvoltFisher{code="0010"}: You look like a trainer who's never caught anything worth a photograph. No offence.
  @portvoltFisher{code="0020"}: Here. My second-best rod. My best one's for me. The fish off Portvolt pier are bigger than you'd think.
  ::give{item="goodRod"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: {{userName}} received the Good Rod!
</beat>

<entry id="eastNedBark" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltFisher" category="bark" when="visited('east.portvolt.nedRod')">
  @portvoltFisher{code="0010"}: Cast off the end of the pier at night. The big ones come up to look at the lighthouse.
</entry>

// ── Marta, the market woman ──────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="eastMartaBark" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltVendor" category="bark">
  @portvoltVendor{code="0010"}: Market's Wednesdays, love. Every stall from here to the lighthouse. Today I'm just mending nets.
</entry>

<entry id="eastMartaMarketDay" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltVendor" category="bark" priority="10" when="clock.weekday == 2">
  @portvoltVendor{code="0010"}: It's market day! Go on, spend something. My stall's the one with the striped awning and no customers.
</entry>

// ── the Spark Gym guide ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="eastPortvoltGuideBefore" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltGymGuide" category="bark" when="!holds('defeated', ['volta'])">
  @portvoltGymGuide{code="0010"}: Yo, challenger! Lt. Volta's gym runs on electricity. Ground types don't feel a thing. Rock types don't like it much either. Water types? Don't bring water types.
</entry>

<entry id="eastPortvoltGuideAfter" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltGymGuide" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['volta'])">
  @portvoltGymGuide{code="0010"}: You beat the Lieutenant! The Spark Badge lets you use Fly outside battle, once someone teaches you. I hear Fern in Bloomfield does.
</entry>

// ── Keeper Sol, at the lighthouse ────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="eastSolBark" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltKeeper" category="bark">
  @portvoltKeeper{code="0010"}: Forty years I've kept this light. Ships see it from Tidewell on a clear night. Ships and other things.
</entry>

<entry id="eastSolMorning" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltKeeper" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isMorning">
  @portvoltKeeper{code="0010"}: Morning. I'm going to bed. The light doesn't need me in daylight, and I don't need it.
</entry>

// At night Sol tells you about the storm bird and asks you to find it
// (quests/east/side-quests.lute, eastThunderwing).
<beat id="solStormBird" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltKeeper" title="The storm bird" priority="20" when="@isNight">
  @portvoltKeeper{code="0010"}: See the flicker down the coast? That's the old power plant, and nobody's paid its bill in ten years.
  @portvoltKeeper{code="0020"}: Something lives in there. On stormy nights I see it from the gallery: a bird made of lightning, sitting on the chimney like it owns the sky.
  @portvoltKeeper{code="0030"}: I'm too old to go and look. You're not. If you ever get close, tell me what it is.
  ::accept{quest="eastThunderwing"}
</beat>

<entry id="eastSolThunderwing" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltKeeper" category="bark" priority="30" when="holds('caught', ['thunderwing'])">
  @portvoltKeeper{code="0010"}: Thunderwing. So that's its name. Forty years I've watched for it, and you walk up and put it in your pocket. Good. It'll be safer with you than on that chimney.
</entry>

// ── Tobin and his voltmouse ──────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="eastTobinBark" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltKid" category="bark">
  @portvoltKid{code="0010"}: My voltmouse gives me a shock every time I pat it. Mum says that means it loves me. I think Mum's making that up.
</entry>

<entry id="eastTobinNight" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltKid" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isNight">
  @portvoltKid{code="0010"}: I'm not supposed to be out. But my voltmouse glows in the dark, so technically I'm not in the dark.
</entry>

<entry id="eastTobinVoltmouse" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltKid" category="bark" priority="20" when="holds('caught', ['voltmouse']) && !@isNight">
  @portvoltKid{code="0010"}: You've got a voltmouse too? Do they shock you? Do you like it? I don't like it. I love it.
</entry>
